# primeBounds

- _primeBounds(n)_

Answer an `Interval` giving an upper and lower bound for the value of `prime` of _n_.

```
>>> 148933.0.primeBounds
(1919558.015 -- 2068491.015)

>>> 148933L.prime
1999993L

>>> let n = 148933;
>>> n.primeBounds
>>> .includes(n.prime)
true
```

* * *

See also: prime, primePiBounds

